name: sim.getStringNamedParam
description:
luaSynopsis: string stringParam=sim.getStringNamedParam(string paramName)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. paramName: the key or name of the parameter
2. paramLength: the size of the parameter
outputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. nullptr if operation was not successful or if such a parameter does not exist. Otherwise the parameter. The user is in charge of releasing the returned buffer with simReleaseBuffer.
replacedBy:
- name: getStringProperty, class: object, file: object_getStringProperty.method, note: "use a 'namedParam.'-prefix for the property name"
